AD  - College of Computer and Information Engineering, Inner Mongolia Agricultural University, Hohhot, 010018, China
AD  - Key Laboratory of Agricultural and Animal Husbandry Big Data Research and Application, Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region, Hohhot, 010018, China
