TI  - MoEQuant: Enhancing Quantization for Mixture-of-Experts Large Language Models via Expert-Balanced Sampling and Affinity Guidance
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of Machine Learning Research
VL  - 267
SP  - 8245
